Package: nomologR
Type: Package
Title: A Two-Step Workflow for Scale Development and Nomological Validation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Joshua", "Uhalt",
      email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Helpers to build unidimensional, reliable measurement models (EFA -> CFA),
    then evaluate convergent, discriminant, and nomological validity via SEM. Provides
    rule-based suggestions and a decision log.
